{"id":"reunio_n","lemma":"reunión","pos":"noun","rank":586,"glosses":["meeting, session, appointment","powwow","collection, gathering, collecting (e.g. of data, evidence, statistics, funds)"],"ipa":"/reuˈnjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"reuniones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/95/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-reuni%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"He fijado una reunión.","en":"I've set up a meeting.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/548149"},{"text":"Las reuniones han concluido.","en":"The meetings are over.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301865"},{"text":"Hoy tengo una reunión.","en":"I have a meeting today.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460821"},{"text":"Sabes que odio las reuniones.","en":"You know I hate meetings.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/585779"},{"text":"Voy a una reunión.","en":"I'm going to a meeting.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/269163"}]}